---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Instructions - Noura Template"
  description="Guide to customizing, configuring, and deploying this template."
>
  <div class="pt-36 pb-24 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <header class="mb-12 border-b border-black/10 pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black mb-3">
        Instructions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-600">
        Everything you need to customize, manage CMS collections, and deploy the site.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed prose prose-neutral">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black mb-4">1. Getting Started</h2>
        <p>
          Noura is a modern creative agency template rebuilt in Astro, Tailwind CSS, and React.
          Pages and articles are rendered statically to HTML for blazingly fast load times and zero runtime script overhead.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black mb-4">2. Managing Case Studies & Articles</h2>
        <p>
          Content is organized cleanly in <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-black/5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">src/content/</code>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-4 text-sm">
          <li><strong>Works</strong>: Add a new Markdown file to <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-black/5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">src/content/works/</code> to automatically generate a case study page.</li>
          <li><strong>Blog</strong>: Add a new article to <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-black/5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">src/content/blog/</code> with frontmatter metadata.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black mb-4">3. Design Tokens & Styling</h2>
        <p>
          All fonts, color definitions, and animations are managed in <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-black/5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">tailwind.config.mjs</code> and <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-black/5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">src/styles/global.css</code>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
